9886925c-5b08-4489-ab72-a667a737a877	phone-call-1794280730327-jk7ygy	baiqi-baiqi-꽉-막힌-도로-위에서	66514517-ce36-4939-8b46-6b58add42aaa	5996ed2d-431f-4d4d-b548-41772416cb28	堵车时间 (꽉 막힌 도로 위에서)	baiqi-꽉-막힌-도로-위에서	call	2026	2026-09-29		t	2026-11-10 03:18:50.90908+00	2026-11-10 03:18:51.565156+00	\N	https://www.youtube.com/embed/8UdQZliT6v0	{"body": "", "level": null, "memoHtml": "<p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p>", "avatarUrl": "", "coverImage": "", "characterKey": "baiqi", "youtubeUrlCn": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/8UdQZliT6v0", "youtubeUrlKr": null, "characterName": "백기", "historySource": "白起·云野牧歌 구름 들판의 목가 획득 통화", "historySummary": "", "historyCategory": "card", "translationHtml": "<p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">나야. 지금 어디쯤이야? 톨게이트는 지났어?</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">아뇨, 톨게이트까지는 아직 한참 남았어요.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">차가 엄청 막혀서 벌써 한참째 꼼짝도 못 하고 있어요.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">게다가 아침에 샌드위치 하나밖에 안 먹어서 그런지 배도 좀 고프네요.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">왜 그렇게 조금밖에 안 먹었어?</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">출발할 때는 배가 안 고팠단 말이에요.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">대충 조금만 먹고 가서 점심에는 선배랑 맛있는 거 잔뜩 먹으려고 했죠!</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">그런데 지금까지 겨우 3분의 1밖에 못 왔을 줄 누가 알았겠어요……</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">지금 위치 좀 보내 줄래?</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">네? 알겠어요…… 보냈어요.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">받았어. 내 기억으로는 앞으로 20킬로미터쯤 가면 휴게소가 하나 있을 거야.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">거기 양고기집 하나 있는데 맛이 꽤 괜찮아. 고기도 아주 부드럽고 누린내도 전혀 안 나.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">와, 그럼 꼭 가서 먹어 봐야겠어요~</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">응. 거기 화덕만두도 맛있어.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">몇 개 포장해서 가져가. 혹시 모르니까 가는 길에 먹을 수 있게.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">오늘 산 쪽 날씨가 안 좋아서 앞으로도 도로 사정이 그리 좋지는 않을 것 같거든.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">알겠어요. 백 경관님 말씀대로 할게요.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">그런데 선배가 말한 가게 이름이 뭐예요? 가서 먹어 보게요~</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">양고기집 하나 있어.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">양고기집인 건 알아요. 가게 이름이 뭐냐고요.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">가게 이름이 ‘양고기집 하나 있어’야.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">네? 이름이 그렇게 직설적이에요? 하하하!</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">여기는 그런 이름을 가진 가게가 많더라고요. 저도 ‘행복한 화덕만두’, ‘나는 수타면이 좋아’, ‘발랄한 양고기구이집’에 가 본 적 있어요.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">다 이름값을 하는 가게들이야. 맛도 괜찮고.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">……그냥 있을 때는 괜찮았는데, 선배가 그렇게 말하니까 더 배고파졌잖아요!! 전부 다 먹어 보고 싶어……</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">걱정 마. 너랑 그 가게들 전부 가 볼 준비는 이미 해 뒀으니까.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">아아, 기대돼요~ 어? 앞에 차가 움직이기 시작했어요!</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">그럼 일단 운전해. 안전 운전하고.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\"><br></span></p><div><br></div>", "historyCategoryLabel": "카드"}	public
