90dfacd7-49fb-4096-8f22-3c0dd364a31a	phone-call-1794611250200-sz9z2g	baiqi-baiqi-이별모임	66514517-ce36-4939-8b46-6b58add42aaa	5996ed2d-431f-4d4d-b548-41772416cb28	离别聚会 (이별모임)	baiqi-이별모임	call	2025	2025-09-24		t	2026-11-13 23:07:30.35139+00	2026-11-13 23:07:31.063981+00	\N	https://www.youtube.com/embed/hVGmexjtmOc	{"body": "", "level": null, "memoHtml": "<p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p>", "avatarUrl": "", "coverImage": "", "characterKey": "baiqi", "youtubeUrlCn": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/hVGmexjtmOc", "youtubeUrlKr": null, "characterName": "백기", "historySource": "금지구역 白起·禁域 진화 통화", "historySummary": "", "historyCategory": "card", "translationHtml": "<p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\"><br></span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">나야, 백기. 토요일 저녁에 일정 있어?</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">아직 확실하진 않은데, 무슨 일 있어요?</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">서하 골목 상점들의 이전 날짜가 확정됐어. 다들 떠나기 전에 모여서 식사하기로 했대.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">저녁 6시, 골목 입구에 있는 바비큐 가게야. 시간 되면 와.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">오, 엄청 북적북적하겠는데요!</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">그런데 저는 그분들이랑 별로 친하지도 않은데, 모임에 참석해도 괜찮을까요?</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">가게 주인들이 네 회사에 새 가게 홍보를 부탁하고 싶어 해.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">네가 곤란하면 굳이 무리할 필요는 없어.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">……</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\"><br></span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">선택지 1｜제가 왔으면 좋겠어요?</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">선배는 제가 왔으면 좋겠어요?</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">……난 그냥 연락만 대신 전하는 거야.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">생각해 보고 탕수이 가게 주인한테 직접 말해.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">난 아직 처리할 보고서가 있어서. 이만 끊을게.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\"><br></span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">선택지 2｜선배도 갈 거예요?</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">그럼 선배는요? 선배도 갈 거예요?</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">기분 봐서.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">그럼 지금 기분은 어때요?</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">그건 그때 기</span><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">분에 달렸지.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">끊을게.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\"><br></span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\"><br></span></p>", "historyCategoryLabel": "카드"}	public
