ede1155a-438f-4c66-b2ce-25614e5b99e0	phone-call-1794761574661-gvjl7f	baiqi-baiqi-그-시절의-산들바람	66514517-ce36-4939-8b46-6b58add42aaa	5996ed2d-431f-4d4d-b548-41772416cb28	旧日风轻 (그 시절의 산들바람)	baiqi-그-시절의-산들바람	call	2026	2026-05-25		t	2026-11-15 16:52:55.25037+00	2026-11-15 16:52:56.043356+00	\N	https://www.youtube.com/embed/TqfMuvqA0V4	{"body": "", "level": null, "memoHtml": "<p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p>", "avatarUrl": "", "coverImage": "", "characterKey": "baiqi", "youtubeUrlCn": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/TqfMuvqA0V4", "youtubeUrlKr": null, "characterName": "백기", "historySource": "구속 없는 자유 白起·百无规束 진화 통화", "historySummary": "", "historyCategory": "card", "translationHtml": "<p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\"><br></span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">이번 주말에 약속 있어?</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">아직은 없어요. 백 경관님, 혹시 제가 협조해야 할 계획이라도 있으신가요?</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">그때가 연모고등학교 개방일이거든. 너랑 같이 학교에 가서 좀 둘러보고 싶어.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">좋아요. 가는 김에 공 선생님께도 인사드릴 수 있겠네요.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">그런데 갑자기 학교 개방일에 가고 싶어진 이유가 뭐예요?</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">너랑 다시 한번 교내 데이트를 하고 싶어서.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">전에 널 빼앗겼으니까, 그만큼은 만회해야지.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">풋…… 선배는 정말 자기 자신을 미워하는 데는 일등이네요.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">내가 원래 이런 사람인 거, 하루 이틀 아는 것도 아니잖아.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">그럼 학교에서 데이트하는 거니까 우리 교복도 입어야 할까요?</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">당연하지. 안 그러면 무슨 '교내 데이트'겠어.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">그렇다면…… 머리 모양도 좀 맞춰야겠네요? 예를 들어 저는 높은 포니테일로 묶는다든가요?</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">뭐든 좋아. 네가 하고 싶은 대로 해. 다 예쁠 테니까.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">그럼 제 남자 친구도 얌전히 손목에 제 머리끈을 차고 있어 줄 건가요?</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">그럼. 가방에도 너랑 한 쌍인 작은 장식품을 달아야지.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">헤헤……</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">그런데 선배는 좀 부끄럽지 않겠어요?</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">성인인 우리 둘이 고등학교 교복을 입고 학교에서 데이트하는 모습을 다른 사람들이 보면……</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">좀 민망하지 않을까요?</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">다른 사람들이 어떻게 생각하든 난 상관없어.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">중요한 건 네 손을 잡고 운동장이랑 복도, 교실을 다시 걸어 보는 거야. 그러다가 아무도 없는 구석을 찾아서 너한테 키스도 하고.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">크흠, 백기 학생. 교내 규율을 준수해 주세요.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">난 이미 졸업했으니까 교칙을 지킬 필요 없어.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">유연</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">잠깐만요. 선배 기준은 너무 제멋대로인 거 아니에요?</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><br data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">백기</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">난 학교 짱이었잖아. 기준이 좀 제멋대로여도 이상할 건 없지, 모범생.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">그럼 교복 사이즈는 내가 미리 확인해 둘게. 점심 도시락도 챙겨 갈 거고.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\">토요일 오전 9시에 데리러 갈게.</span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\"><br></span></p><p data-smarteditor-blank-line=\\"1\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\\"><br></span></p>", "historyCategoryLabel": "카드"}	public
